  "diagnosis": {
    "root_cause": "The workflow is intentionally designed to call an endpoint (https://httpstat.us/500) that should return an HTTP 500 error, and curl is configured with --fail which makes it exit with an error when the HTTP response code indicates failure. However, the actual error encountered is 'curl: (52) Empty reply from server', meaning the server at httpstat.us closed the connection without sending any HTTP response at all. This is a network/service availability issue with the external httpstat.us service, not a problem with the workflow code itself. The workflow expects to receive an HTTP 500 status code but instead received no response, which is a different failure mode. Multiple repository issues (#111, #140, #452) document repeated failures of this same workflow, suggesting the httpstat.us service may be unreliable or experiencing intermittent issues.",
