    "suggested_fix": "The httpstat.us service appears to be unreliable. Consider replacing it with a more stable alternative such as httpbin.org (e.g., https://httpbin.org/status/500) or mockbin.org, or set up a local mock server within the workflow itself using a simple Python/Node.js HTTP server that returns a 500 status. Alternatively, if testing external service failure handling is not the primary goal, consider whether this test workflow is necessary at all given its dependency on an unreliable third-party service.",
